      "comment": "JUMBUK EILEEN (1) jumps from box 1 for the first time after placing latest at Traralgon (20.34) in a Grade 5. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Capable of going well again. GREEN FROG CAFE (3) turned heads when posting an excellent 24.34 over 435m at this track three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Has the ability and looks a key chance. KOPACKI RIT (5) placed three back at Shepparton then out of the placings last couple but moves to box 5 this time where he has performed well. Has the ability and can find best this time. DAINTREE GAV (2) is always a threat when he races at this journey.",
